# Profiling/simulator data lives in profile_data/ (kernels/ = committed curated grids;
# results/ = regenerable measured grids + prediction outputs; _archive/ = stale scratch).
# Both the no-slash and slash forms are needed: the trailing-slash pattern matches only a
# DIRECTORY at that path, so a SYMLINK named profile_data/results slips past it and gets
# committed — checking that commit out then silently REPLACES the real (ignored) data
# directory with the symlink (2026-06-12 incident: lane-worktree symlink merged via PR #75
# deleted the local shared results store; see profiling/docs/results_store_incident_2026-06-12.md).
profile_data/results
profile_data/results/
profile_data/_archive
profile_data/_archive/

