# sweep_sentry journal — auto-generated by the cron harness, churns every 2h

# Per-GPU per-conc realized + trajectory-pool calibration artifacts
# (inference-benchmark/data/distributions/*_realized_*.json) are COMMITTED as of S13
# (2026-06-10), minified: the full Llama-3.1-8B ground-truth set is ~20MB minified
# (the former ~105MB that justified gitignoring was pretty-print whitespace, not data;
# largest single file 0.5MB). When they were gitignored, fresh checkouts silently fell
# back to the pooled cohort and invalidated TTFT/E2EL replay gates (flipped two
# verdicts 2026-06-09/10). Regenerate via
# `python -m profiling.process.build_realized_session_distributions`,
# then re-minify (json separators (',', ':')) before committing.
